# =============================================================================
# ↢ — Await-directed binding initializer
# =============================================================================
#
# What this teaches:
#   • Keep fixum, varia, or sit while awaiting the initializer.
#   • The glyph is a binding boundary, not an inline expression operator.
#   • A stored promissum can be resolved in a later declaration.
#
# See also: figendum, variandum, fiet, promissum
# =============================================================================

``
`fab
functio responde(numerus value) fiet → numerus {
    redde value
}

incipiet {
    fixum promissum<numerus> pending ← responde(7)
    fixum numerus immutable ↢ pending
    varia numerus mutable ↢ responde(8)
    sit inferred ↢ responde(9)
}
`
``
